[{"answer":"I used to be very shy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I would not go up to someone that I did not know and say hello.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I was afraid that people would not want to talk to me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I have changed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I have become less shy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I have learned that making friends is easy to do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/6.mp3"},{"answer":"All you have to do is say hello.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Most people will respond to a smile and a friendly hello.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/8.mp3"},{"answer":"People will begin to talk to you about little things in their lives.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/9.mp3"},{"answer":"You will soon realize that you have something in common with that person.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Whenever I start talking to a new person","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I find that there is some interest that we share.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe we know some of the same people,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/13.mp3"},{"answer":"or we went to the same school.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Often we find that we like the same music or the same movies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/15.mp3"},{"answer":"It is easy to have a conversation with someone","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/16.mp3"},{"answer":"once you find a topic that you can both relate to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/17.mp3"},{"answer":"The most important part in making friends is to listen to what the other person says.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/18.mp3"},{"answer":"If you take an interest in them,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/19.mp3"},{"answer":"they are sure to take an interest in you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/20.mp3"},{"answer":"I have learned many things from meeting people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I have had many fascinating conversations,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/22.mp3"},{"answer":"and I have made a lot of good friends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/23.mp3"},{"answer":"One day a girl came up to me and said that she was lost.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/24.mp3"},{"answer":"She couldn't find her way to her English class.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I said that I was going to that class too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I told her to come with me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/27.mp3"},{"answer":"We began talking, and we became very good friends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/28.mp3"},{"answer":"That was a few years ago.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/29.mp3"},{"answer":"She is still one of my best friends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Just think, if she hadn't been lost","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/31.mp3"},{"answer":"we might never have become friends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/95-making-friends-2019-04-07-03-51-35/32.mp3"}]
